 image 20241022130021.png", "x": -2040, "y": -24, "width": 400, "height": 34}, {"id": "8046afae92d38430", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022201137.png", "x": -1160, "y": 2127, "width": 400, "height": 32}, {"id": "e21d12912768446e", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022201142.png", "x": -1160, "y": 2178, "width": 399, "height": 159}, {"id": "427629ecbf748f7d", "type": "text", "text": "Для задачи неразл-разл $\\ge 1$: разложим по одному неразличимому предмету по ящикам. Тогда останется  $n-k$ предметов, для которых формула $\\left({k \\choose n-k}\\right)={k+n-k-1\\choose n-k}= {n-1\\choose n-k}= {n-1\\choose (n-1)-(n-k)}  = {n-1\\choose k-1}$", "x": -2040, "y": 1800, "width": 400, "height": 160}, {"id": "201249b7434128fe", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022225057.png", "x": -240, "y": 2127, "width": 400, "height": 39}, {"id": "49f3223934008977", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022225428.png", "x": -240, "y": 2187, "width": 399, "height": 99}, {"id": "6e209a34520d9568", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022225642.png", "x": -240, "y": 2307, "width": 397, "height": 55}, {"id": "c12007e08b41c9d7", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022225902.png", "x": -240, "y": 2387, "width": 400, "height": 136}, {"id": "1b9e9451d1fc5748", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022221156.png", "x": -700, "y": 2125, "width": 400, "height": 34}, {"id": "a4129c2ee7326dcd", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022202232.png", "x": -1160, "y": 2363, "width": 400, "height": 384}, {"id": "987b7d9d8e88d5f6", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022202302.png", "x": -1160, "y": 2780, "width": 400, "height": 147}, {"id": "284af661edbde059", "type": "file", "file": "assets/images/Pasted image 20241022221554.png", "x": -700, "y": 2178, "width": 400, "height": 650}, {"id": "047d4cc044314312", "type